'''Pumpkin Sodom''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 13.7 Update|Version 13.7]] and can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule|Rare Cat Capsule]] during the [[Halloween Capsules (Gacha Event)|Halloween Capsules]] event. It is an [[:Category:Anti-Metal Cats|anti-Metal]] variant of [[Sodom (Uber Rare Cat)|Sodom]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 772
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Pumpkin Sodom
|name2 = Sodom-o'-Lantern
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Sodom-o'-Lantern''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Sodom-o'-Lantern is an extreme [[:Category:Anti-Metal Cats|anti-Metal]] specialist whose Metal Killer and Resistant to [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] abilities give him incredible damage and high effective health against Metal. With his niche, Sodom-o'-Lantern is extremely powerful, making any [[:Category:Critical Hit Cats|Critter]]'s job much easier as one hit from Sodom-o'-Lantern will shave off a third of a Metal enemy's health. Sodom-o'-Lantern boasts high base health, but has low speed and a low knockback count of only 2, giving it practically no repositioning. In stages without Metal enemies, Pumpkin Sodom is heavily outclassed due to his low speed and attack rate and should not be used.

{{Job|Classification = Crowd-Controller & Midranger}}

